    "items": [
      "Each hold has the Jarl placed in its court at the start and a second Jarl placed in their own house; that the civil war swaps the two is `[unverified]` (the CW scripts were not read). Every Jarl is in `JobJarlFaction` 050920; every housecarl but Bolgeir Bearclaw is in `JobHousecarlFaction` 05091F. All are `Unique`; all are `Essential` except Balgruuf, Gorm, Olfina and Helvard (Helvard is `Protected`).",
      "The rows: no other record keeps its own level. The only records that use a Jarl as their template, `MQ304Ulfric` 0EA581 and `MQ304Galmar` 0EA582 (on Stormcloaks → *Named Stormcloaks*), carry `Stats` and follow `Ulfric` and `Galmar`. No leveled list draws a Jarl or a housecarl."
    ]
  },
